        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 2,
      "caption": "Sounding my pockets and finding only a few pieces of silver, I told myself to inquire the price and not be too particular where I lodged.",
      "caption_zone": "bottom_center",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_002/final_frames/frame_002.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_002/final_lettered_frames/frame_002.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 3,
      "caption": "I left the Crossed Harpoons and the glowing Sword-Fish behind\u2014too expensive and jolly\u2014and turned waterward for cheaper inns.",
      "caption_zone": "bottom_right",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_002/final_frames/frame_003.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_002/final_lettered_frames/frame_003.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 4,
      "caption": "Blundering into a public-looking doorway, I stumbled over an ash-box, choked, opened the inner door on a thundering preacher and his flock, and straightway backed out.",
      "caption_zone": "top_right",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_002/final_frames/frame_004.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_002/final_lettered_frames/frame_004.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 5,
      "caption": "Then I saw the swinging sign with a tall jet of spray\u2014ominous names or no\u2014and judged this the very spot for cheap lodgings, so I made for the door.",
      "caption_zone": "top_center",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_002/final_frames/frame_005.png",
